        {
          "title": "Find the gradient",
          "body": "The reflex angle at \\(C\\) in the hexagon is\n\\[\n720^\\circ-(90^\\circ+95^\\circ+149^\\circ+104^\\circ+57^\\circ)=225^\\circ\n\\]"
